ISO-10303-21;
/* N006: pcurve B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS has non-uniform knots vs 3D curve; parameter-by-parameter sampling drifts; edge tolerance silently inflated to 1.0E-3; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET — OCC yields empty */
